00:41:32.729 --> 00:41:34.732
Wouldn't you like to know...

294
00:41:41.239 --> 00:41:45.578
"...what a ghoul with a human scent

295
00:41:46.078 --> 00:41:48.705
Mr. Tsukiyama!

296
00:41:49.332 --> 00:41:54.046
A new sensation in scent and taste!

297
00:42:01.763 --> 00:42:03.474
Please enjoy...

298
00:42:05.059 --> 00:42:07.061
...the ultimate delight.

299
00:43:07.923 --> 00:43:09.551
Your eye...

300
00:43:56.021 --> 00:43:57.482
CCG.

301
00:44:42.784 --> 00:44:43.952
How rare!

302
00:44:45.955 --> 00:44:47.581
A delicacy...

303
00:45:28.379 --> 00:45:29.630
Feeling better?

304
00:45:30.006 --> 00:45:31.132
Thank you.

305
00:45:33.844 --> 00:45:39.098
"Itori nearly got you killed."

306
00:45:39.851 --> 00:45:43.313
"It was my fault."

307
00:45:51.740 --> 00:45:53.533
Many ghouls were there.

308
00:45:56.286 --> 00:45:57.329
They all...

309
00:46:00.249 --> 00:46:02.251
...watched a human bleed...

310
00:46:04.463 --> 00:46:06.006
...and laughed.

311
00:46:11.387 --> 00:46:16.477
"Inevitably, more ghouls are showing"

312
00:46:19.813 --> 00:46:26.363
"Kaneki, do you feel guilty

313
00:46:27.782 --> 00:46:31.285
No. It doesn't really occur to me.

314
00:46:31.827 --> 00:46:34.206
If you don't see them alive,

315
00:46:35.082 --> 00:46:38.919
"it's hard to feel guilty"

316
00:46:41.129 --> 00:46:44.801
Many ghouls prey on humans themselves,

317
00:46:45.594 --> 00:46:48.389
and confront the act of killing.

318
00:46:51.601 --> 00:46:57.566
"Ghouls aren't so fearless

319
00:46:57.858 --> 00:46:59.944
They suppress their emotions.

320
00:47:00.945 --> 00:47:03.699
Ghouls who have lived like that

321
00:47:05.117 --> 00:47:08.120
eventually forget the value of life.

322
00:47:11.291 --> 00:47:15.128
But Kaneki, does that apply

323
00:47:15.504 --> 00:47:17.840
to all the ghouls you know?

324
00:47:21.553 --> 00:47:22.595
It doesn't.

325
00:47:26.433 --> 00:47:28.477
Try not to act rashly.

326
00:47:30.563 --> 00:47:33.190
"If you need help,

327
00:47:33.900 --> 00:47:35.193
Thank you.

328
00:47:51.921 --> 00:47:54.049
Mr. Yoshimura is right.

329
00:47:56.342 --> 00:47:57.887
He's right, but...

330
00:48:01.349 --> 00:48:03.225
Some ghouls are good.

331
00:48:05.479 --> 00:48:07.481
Even some humans too.

332
00:48:10.943 --> 00:48:13.403
But there are more who aren't.

333
00:48:15.908 --> 00:48:19.703
Humans, and ghouls.

334
00:48:46.068 --> 00:48:47.236
Hello...

335
00:48:47.694 --> 00:48:48.946
Touka.

336
00:48:49.947 --> 00:48:50.947
Yoriko...

337
00:48:51.322 --> 00:48:53.201
Sorry to just turn up.

338
00:48:54.077 --> 00:48:57.998
"The other day,"

339
00:48:58.123 --> 00:49:01.836
"Like something bad happened."

340
00:49:07.801 --> 00:49:10.304
You've been skipping school too.

341
00:49:13.891 --> 00:49:16.394
This is all I can do to help.

342
00:49:24.279 --> 00:49:26.573
"No thanks."

343
00:49:28.117 --> 00:49:30.995
"But, when you feel down,

344
00:49:31.120 --> 00:49:32.538
No thanks!

345
00:49:47.139 --> 00:49:49.933
Sorry. You didn't want it.

346
00:50:24.557 --> 00:50:25.808
Quit staring.

347
00:50:54.968 --> 00:50:56.511
Nishio?

348
00:51:39.436 --> 00:51:42.440
Hey... Hey...

349
00:51:44.775 --> 00:51:47.487
"Aren't you..."

350
00:51:48.196 --> 00:51:50.448
It kinda seems like it.

351
00:51:50.991 --> 00:51:51.993
Who are you?

352
00:51:52.577 --> 00:51:54.536
Kaneki...

353
00:51:56.706 --> 00:51:59.418
Oh, you're Nishiki's buddy?

354
00:52:00.044 --> 00:52:01.795
A-Actually, I'm not...

355
00:52:08.011 --> 00:52:11.474
Hey... Um...

356
00:53:06.371 --> 00:53:07.747
Are you okay?

357
00:53:21.763 --> 00:53:26.018
"I'll kill 'em."

358
00:53:28.147 --> 00:53:30.898
When I get better, watch out...

359
00:53:31.984 --> 00:53:33.068
Yeah yeah.

360
00:53:33.193 --> 00:53:34.404
You're home.

361
00:53:34.696 --> 00:53:35.864
Nishiki!

362
00:53:39.952 --> 00:53:41.412
Thank God.

363
00:53:43.414 --> 00:53:44.623
Kimi...

364
00:53:46.126 --> 00:53:47.419
Are you okay?

365
00:53:51.966 --> 00:53:55.844
"What happened to you?"

366
00:53:56.929 --> 00:53:57.973
You okay?

367
00:53:58.307 --> 00:53:59.307
Nishio.

368
00:54:08.192 --> 00:54:09.319
Lie down.

369
00:54:12.114 --> 00:54:15.326
"You're hurt!"

370
00:54:17.454 --> 00:54:23.085
"This hunger is driving me crazy."

371
00:54:23.836 --> 00:54:25.463
You need to rest.

372
00:54:32.346 --> 00:54:36.226
Okay... I'd better go.

373
00:54:39.980 --> 00:54:41.023
Hey you!

374
00:54:44.276 --> 00:54:45.528
You're a ghoul?

375
00:54:53.371 --> 00:54:58.418
Please. Don't tell anyone about us.

376
00:55:04.259 --> 00:55:09.765
You're... human, aren't you?

377
00:55:13.810 --> 00:55:16.314
You know he's a ghoul?

378
00:55:20.402 --> 00:55:24.740
Kimi... Can I ask you something?

379
00:55:28.704 --> 00:55:33.166
You're... not scared?

380
00:55:35.794 --> 00:55:37.463
Even if he kills people?

381
00:55:44.305 --> 00:55:49.561
"I think... as long as he doesn't

382
00:55:50.812 --> 00:55:52.982
I can look the other way.

383
00:55:54.984 --> 00:55:56.903
He needs dead flesh.

384
00:56:00.949 --> 00:56:03.076
If I'd been born a ghoul,

385
00:56:04.913 --> 00:56:06.998
I'd be a killer too.

386
00:56:15.758 --> 00:56:19.596
I was... born human by chance.

387
00:56:20.221 --> 00:56:22.391
So I don't have to kill.

388
00:56:34.656 --> 00:56:39.619
"Listen..."

389
00:56:41.163 --> 00:56:47.253
"I could... get some for Nishio.

390
00:56:48.088 --> 00:56:50.340
"...feed it to him,

391
00:56:51.383 --> 00:56:52.551
Really?

392
00:56:53.803 --> 00:56:54.679
Yes.

393
00:56:57.933 --> 00:56:59.558
Thank you.

394
00:57:01.436 --> 00:57:02.562
Thank you!

395
00:57:31.596 --> 00:57:32.597
Kimi...

396
00:57:53.414 --> 00:57:57.251
"Finally feel like eating?"

397
00:58:01.131 --> 00:58:04.093
No. Not me.

398
00:58:04.218 --> 00:58:07.346
This is... for Nishio.

399
00:58:08.264 --> 00:58:12.352
"Nishiki Nishio? Why?"

400
00:58:38.883 --> 00:58:40.094
What's this?

401
00:58:44.932 --> 00:58:49.104
"Dear Kaneki,"

402
00:58:49.562 --> 00:58:54.652
"The lovely lady you were talking with"

403
00:58:55.111 --> 00:58:58.782
"Let's enjoy a special night,"

404
00:58:59.825 --> 00:59:04.956
"P.S. No need for alarm."

405
00:59:05.957 --> 00:59:09.001
"...yet."

406
00:59:10.170 --> 00:59:11.338
No way...

407
00:59:11.547 --> 00:59:13.549
What "lovely lady"?

408
00:59:14.341 --> 00:59:15.592
Kimi.

409
00:59:16.803 --> 00:59:20.140
Nishio's... girlfriend.

410
00:59:20.265 --> 00:59:22.101
Why his girlfriend?

411
00:59:23.811 --> 00:59:27.857
Kimi is... human.

412
00:59:30.694 --> 00:59:31.820
I've gotta go.

413
00:59:31.987 --> 00:59:32.988
Wait!

414
00:59:35.241 --> 00:59:37.702
If she's human, forget her.

415
00:59:37.827 --> 00:59:38.828
But, Kimi is...

416
00:59:38.995 --> 00:59:40.455
Snap out of it!

417
00:59:43.834 --> 00:59:46.713
It's dangerous if humans find out.

418
00:59:51.259 --> 00:59:52.720
That's why I...

419
00:59:54.638 --> 00:59:55.764
Touka?

420
00:59:58.894 --> 00:59:59.978
Touka...

421
01:00:02.898 --> 01:00:04.859
"- Nishio!"

422
01:00:05.276 --> 01:00:06.569
Where's Kimi?

423
01:00:16.122 --> 01:00:17.123
Look.

424
01:00:27.051 --> 01:00:28.929
Dammit!

425
01:00:31.056 --> 01:00:32.766
This is a nightmare.

426
01:00:34.769 --> 01:00:38.189
Why? Why is this happening?!

427
01:00:38.314 --> 01:00:41.318
"I'll go."

428
01:00:45.489 --> 01:00:46.574
I'm coming too.

429
01:00:46.699 --> 01:00:49.160
"Not like that!"

430
01:00:49.285 --> 01:00:53.040
"You think I can"

431
01:00:57.211 --> 01:01:00.924
Alright. We'll go together.

432
01:01:06.305 --> 01:01:07.473
Kaneki!

433
01:01:12.938 --> 01:01:16.734
Touka... Let's talk later.

434
01:01:57.114 --> 01:02:01.494
Kaneki? Is Beethoven to your liking?

435
01:02:02.412 --> 01:02:04.332
Tsukiyama...

436
01:02:08.252 --> 01:02:11.715
Nishio, would you mind leaving?

437
01:02:14.051 --> 01:02:18.348
Give Kimi... back to me...

438
01:02:25.564 --> 01:02:29.527
"This female is the spice"

439
01:02:31.571 --> 01:02:36.660
"I hope to serve her to Kaneki"

440
01:02:43.752 --> 01:02:45.587
To be more specific,

441
01:02:47.632 --> 01:02:49.675
Kaneki will eat her,

442
01:02:51.928 --> 01:02:54.056
while I eat Kaneki!

443
01:02:55.933 --> 01:02:57.768
That is my desire.

444
01:03:00.522 --> 01:03:01.523
You're a freak.

445
01:03:04.944 --> 01:03:06.070
A freak?

446
01:03:07.238 --> 01:03:08.823
How insulting.

447
01:03:19.252 --> 01:03:21.671
You're making me this way.

448
01:03:23.006 --> 01:03:25.008
Take responsibility.

449
01:03:29.472 --> 01:03:31.349
Get lost!

450
01:03:36.021 --> 01:03:37.273
Nishio!

451
01:04:09.351 --> 01:04:10.937
Magnificent.

452
01:04:12.355 --> 01:04:17.153
"The more your blood flows,

453
01:04:17.737 --> 01:04:20.156
Stop doing that!

454
01:04:36.592 --> 01:04:39.178
Your flesh needs tenderizing.

455
01:04:51.234 --> 01:04:52.236
Kaneki.

456
01:04:55.239 --> 01:04:57.366
What would you like next?

457
01:05:09.129 --> 01:05:10.590
How about this?

458
01:05:13.718 --> 01:05:15.345
A surprise attack.

459
01:05:17.640 --> 01:05:22.229
"Oh dear oh dear."

460
01:05:23.397 --> 01:05:24.606
Touka...

461
01:05:26.817 --> 01:05:29.487
"If you die,"

462
01:05:31.698 --> 01:05:36.120
"I'll beat you down"

463
01:06:09.408 --> 01:06:11.578
Leave Kaneki and me alone.

464
01:06:29.682 --> 01:06:35.189
"I won't let you eat me."

465
01:07:27.082 --> 01:07:29.752
Truly delightful...

466
01:07:52.571 --> 01:07:54.197
Marvelous.

467
01:07:55.574 --> 01:07:57.951
Marvelous...

468
01:08:03.124 --> 01:08:06.086
Now, let's sample you.

469
01:09:21.256 --> 01:09:22.717
Très...

470
01:09:26.680 --> 01:09:28.181
Très bien...

471
01:09:38.151 --> 01:09:39.403
What is this?

472
01:09:42.532 --> 01:09:44.284
What is this flavor?

473
01:09:55.881 --> 01:09:58.718
Oh no. Oh no!

474
01:10:01.721 --> 01:10:03.723
It's beyond expectation!

475
01:10:08.270 --> 01:10:11.566
However! However...

476
01:10:13.026 --> 01:10:16.739
My quest is far from over yet.

477
01:10:18.741 --> 01:10:25.789
"I must not allow Ken Kaneki"

478
01:10:38.221 --> 01:10:44.103
"Now... it is time"

479
01:10:54.282 --> 01:10:55.951
Tsukiyama!

480
01:11:03.334 --> 01:11:05.337
Do not interrupt dinner.

481
01:12:04.573 --> 01:12:05.866
Touka...

482
01:12:29.060 --> 01:12:31.729
Now where were we, Kaneki?

483
01:12:54.005 --> 01:12:55.465
Stop...

484
01:12:56.674 --> 01:12:57.884
Stop this!

485
01:13:04.100 --> 01:13:09.064
"Eating humans is a luxury"

486
01:13:22.079 --> 01:13:25.500
"How can you..."

487
01:13:26.835 --> 01:13:28.546
...so easily?

488
01:13:36.513 --> 01:13:38.265
Don't you know...

489
01:13:43.312 --> 01:13:45.148
...what life is worth?

490
01:13:54.701 --> 01:14:00.583
"The value of life?"

491
01:14:03.334 --> 01:14:05.839
"Like them,"

492
01:14:07.257 --> 01:14:12.722
"But with regard to all lifeforms,"

493
01:14:20.480 --> 01:14:21.648
Nevertheless...

494
01:14:24.319 --> 01:14:29.200
"Unlike them,"

495
01:14:54.437 --> 01:14:55.562
What is that?

496
01:14:57.106 --> 01:14:59.360
That revolting scar...

497
01:15:16.797 --> 01:15:18.048
Kimi!

498
01:15:25.932 --> 01:15:27.683
You're irritating me.

499
01:15:28.058 --> 01:15:30.104
You hurt her, you die.

500
01:15:32.273 --> 01:15:35.234
"Even if you kill me,"

501
01:16:07.188 --> 01:16:09.858
Touka! Are you okay?

502
01:16:13.321 --> 01:16:15.531
Do I look okay to you?

503
01:16:17.868 --> 01:16:18.869
Touka...

504
01:16:22.122 --> 01:16:26.544
"When ghouls..."

505
01:16:28.212 --> 01:16:29.882
they recover, right?

506
01:16:41.312 --> 01:16:42.312
Kimi...

507
01:16:59.917 --> 01:17:03.712
Nishiki! What's wrong?!

508
01:17:08.468 --> 01:17:09.803
Go to hospital.

509
01:17:11.806 --> 01:17:13.057
If you don't...

510
01:17:17.729 --> 01:17:19.398
Nishiki, are you...

511
01:17:24.319 --> 01:17:26.239
Let me eat you.

512
01:17:32.287 --> 01:17:34.999
Nishiki, you're a ghoul?

513
01:17:38.670 --> 01:17:40.504
Oh well...

514
01:17:43.134 --> 01:17:45.469
Is this where I check out?

515
01:18:03.407 --> 01:18:05.118
Don't you wanna run?

516
01:18:29.687 --> 01:18:31.022
You know...

517
01:18:32.941 --> 01:18:37.322
When you first spoke to me,

518
01:18:38.031 --> 01:18:41.035
"my family had just died

519
01:18:42.203 --> 01:18:43.621
I was so sad,

520
01:18:45.539 --> 01:18:49.294
"and in so much pain,"

521
01:18:51.338 --> 01:18:56.552
"But... you were there for me."

522
01:19:00.349 --> 01:19:04.979
So... it's okay.

523
01:19:08.608 --> 01:19:10.193
Save yourself.

524
01:19:30.968 --> 01:19:31.927
I won't.

525
01:19:33.136 --> 01:19:34.681
How could I?

526
01:19:40.019 --> 01:19:41.230
Not like this.

527
01:19:48.863 --> 01:19:50.657
You really... think I could?!

528
01:20:18.481 --> 01:20:19.899
Kimi...

529
01:20:24.655 --> 01:20:26.324
You nuisance.

530
01:20:49.225 --> 01:20:50.685
You nuisance.

531
01:20:52.688 --> 01:20:56.359
"You nuisance."

532
01:21:28.730 --> 01:21:30.732
Tsukiyama!

533
01:21:39.242 --> 01:21:40.828
Are you ready?

534
01:21:47.836 --> 01:21:49.003
Don't look.

535
01:22:08.067 --> 01:22:09.861
He belongs to me!

536
01:22:22.710 --> 01:22:23.753
Crazy.

537
01:22:26.297 --> 01:22:31.303
"Not a single thing in this place"

538
01:24:21.848 --> 01:24:25.978
This... isn't good.

539
01:24:38.576 --> 01:24:40.453
You leave me no choice.

540
01:24:45.792 --> 01:24:48.963
She was not on my menu, but...

541
01:24:52.801 --> 01:24:55.304
...I shall dine strategically.

542
01:26:46.934 --> 01:26:51.230
K... Kaneki...

543
01:26:54.735 --> 01:26:55.944
One bite...

544
01:27:00.784 --> 01:27:02.952
Just... one bite...

545
01:27:20.014 --> 01:27:23.936
"Eat yourself."

546
01:27:35.032 --> 01:27:36.117
Kimi...

547
01:27:43.583 --> 01:27:46.795
Nishiki. Back off.

548
01:27:58.725 --> 01:28:01.312
She knows about you and Kaneki.

549
01:28:02.981 --> 01:28:05.192
Too risky to let her live.

550
01:28:10.197 --> 01:28:11.283
You can't...

551
01:28:12.951 --> 01:28:17.999
You can't... kill her.

552
01:28:23.630 --> 01:28:25.215
If Yoriko...

553
01:28:28.427 --> 01:28:33.516
If Yoriko found out about you...

554
01:28:36.103 --> 01:28:37.980
...could you kill her?!

555
01:28:44.321 --> 01:28:45.739
Shut up.

556
01:28:47.866 --> 01:28:49.576
Why don't you get it?!

557
01:28:50.076 --> 01:28:53.040
I've gotta kill Kimi to prevent that!

558
01:28:55.041 --> 01:28:56.293
Touka!

559
01:29:15.815 --> 01:29:16.816
So pretty...

560
01:29:37.508 --> 01:29:40.302
You say that... now?

561
01:30:11.214 --> 01:30:12.465
Nishiki?

562
01:30:16.845 --> 01:30:18.180
You're okay?

563
01:30:20.349 --> 01:30:21.475
Kimi...

564
01:30:24.521 --> 01:30:28.150
Nishiki? Nishiki!

565
01:30:29.193 --> 01:30:30.445
Nishiki!

566
01:30:31.487 --> 01:30:32.739
Nishiki!

567
01:30:58.727 --> 01:31:00.772
As if it's pretty.

568
01:31:22.963 --> 01:31:24.549
I'm so clumsy.

569
01:31:24.758 --> 01:31:25.926
Be careful.

570
01:31:26.176 --> 01:31:27.260
Sorry.

571
01:31:33.601 --> 01:31:35.854
Way to go, fumble fingers.

572
01:31:36.729 --> 01:31:38.649
Waitering's not for you.

573
01:31:38.941 --> 01:31:40.192
Sorry.

574
01:31:49.078 --> 01:31:50.579
Hey Kaneki.

575
01:31:53.290 --> 01:31:57.254
You know... You're...

576
01:31:59.799 --> 01:32:01.676
...too nice.

577
01:32:02.593 --> 01:32:04.262
So I'm told.

578
01:32:05.472 --> 01:32:09.768
"But actually,"

579
01:32:11.896 --> 01:32:14.983
You might save somebody someday.

580
01:32:23.243 --> 01:32:24.161
I'm going.

581
01:32:24.286 --> 01:32:25.370
"- Take care."

582
01:32:25.704 --> 01:32:26.705
I have arrived...

583
01:32:26.830 --> 01:32:29.167
Oh, Touka. Take care!

584
01:32:33.379 --> 01:32:34.589
Adorable.

585
